### scheme/swift/stable/remangler.go
Context: The linter committed this file as part of the prior R3+R4 commit
(0af2678). My session added the following (already in HEAD):

R11: mangleDependentGenericParamType()
- Calls decodeGenericParamText() to recover (depth, index) from Text
- Text format: 'A'+index for depth=0; 'A'+index + itoa(depth) for depth>0
- Encoding rules (Remangler.cpp::mangleDependentGenericParamType ~line 2560):
  - depth=0, index=0  → "x"
  - depth=0, index=1  → "q_"
  - depth=0, index≥2  → "q<index-2>_"
  - depth=1, index=0  → "qd_"   (no digit, not "qd0_" — important fix)
  - depth=1, index≥1  → "qd<index-1>_"
  - depth>1           → ErrUnsupported (parser only handles depth≤1)
- decodeGenericParamText() helper: parses "A"→(0,0), "B"→(0,1), "A1"→(1,0)

R15: mangleVariableAccessor(n, suffix)
- Emits all path children (module, intermediate identifiers with optional
  Attrs["swift.nominalKind"]) then the type node, then suffix (vg/vs/vp)
- Node structure: [Module, Identifier*..., Identifier(declName), Type]
- Intermediate Identifier nodes carry Attrs["swift.nominalKind"] = "V"/"C"/"O"/"P"

R15: mangleInitDeinit(n, suffix)
- Emits path children, then result type, then params type, then suffix
  (cfC for KindAllocatingInit, cfc for KindInitializer,
   cfD for KindDeallocatingDeinit, cfd for KindDeinit)
- KindEmptyList children emit as 'y' (void tuple)

R15: mangleInitType() helper: emits 'y' for KindEmptyList, else recurses.

remangleNode() switch updated with cases for all 11 new node kinds.

